      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: It's just, I'm partially worried about the whole legal sort of thing depending on what kind of models you make and I'd hate to see this place go. If it's your own stuff sure it's just I'm worried for someone who thinks selling a model of, let's say kirby, and then getting nintendo or whatever company involved with said IP owner coming to shut this whole place down. I'm all for people being paid for their services it's mostly, the people who'd sell models of ips not of their own.",
