      "value": "@{5a3e0052682bb9742d24a733|full_name}: Even though no details have been given yet about how it will work, I'm 99.9% certain you won't be able to just upload, in this case, a kirby model and start immediately being able to make cash. I'm sure the dev team has given this issue a lot of thought already.\nLegally as of right now -you-, the player are responsible for what content you upload to VRchat. You know that checkbox that says you have the rights to upload the avatar before you can upload it? I'm sure something similar would be for the avatar market, so you'd be the one Nintendo goes after instead of VRchat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
