      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: Then they would be responsible for the content, as they would be providing and earning money from possibly copyrighted content, not just that, Stolen unity scripts, Ripped meshes and textures. These things are harder to notice and would need a HUGE team for approval. Adding currency will imo ruin VRchat just like it ruined Valve's MP games and Second life",
