  "details": "Since an monetized avatar market of some form is planned for the future, I would want to be able to create an optional \"official\" avatar market world players could enter instead of just browsing through the avatar market GUI.\nI would create the world just like any other world, but people would for example be able to inspect the models up close and maybe even try them out temporary in-world only. Of course buy the models as well.",
